1. Introduction
A cloud-based application that helps colleges manage student attendance online.
2. Problem Analysis
Manual attendance takes time, causes errors and makes record maintenance difficult.
3. Proposed Solution
Develop an online system where teachers mark attendance, students check attendance percentages, and admins generate reports.
4. Benefits and Challenges
Benefits:
Saves time.
Reduces errors.
Easy access to records.
Challenges:
Requires internet.
Needs data security.
Requires user training.
5. Conclusion
This system reduces paperwork and makes attendance management simple, fast and accurate.
